{"3126410":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Expedition: Into Darkness","steam_appid":3126410,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5041080],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin your journey on foreboding grounds above ancient, mysterious ruins. Driven by an insatiable thirst for glory, power, and untold riches, you will battle innumerable deadly creatures and uncover dark secrets as you pursue your damned ambitions.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/1136205c219da7b7816689ef26548c66.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party with up to four other friends, or, if you're brave enough, enter the darkness alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/70e744ea31e46cfebba20c101484d5ad.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble weapons from individual components: swords, maces, axes, polearms, spears, bows, or crossbows—the choice is yours. Customise all gear with materials, tints, and liveries to perfectly suit your playstyle and sense of fashion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/1b114a21c0de0ab6cd7385a8aaae368e.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means losing your character and everything they carry, permanently. If you want to return out alive with your hard-earned loot—be careful and deliberate. Anything stored in your base camp is safe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/63bf5dc5e47a633477d5594de1005dd3.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with resources from the depths to repair and upgrade your base of operations—exploit upgrades to assist with your next venture for more riches and antediluvian knowledge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/ce5dc924448216ec9a629aba62c74ff4.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmarish creatures, deadly traps, unstable structures, hidden drops, and toxic gasses—you have been warned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/4e5b46569a5c8b8f33deaf2c5d447801.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside piety and reach beyond the Empyrean to make deals with dark gods in exchange for forbidden power, but remember—everything comes at a price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin your journey on foreboding grounds above ancient, mysterious ruins. Driven by an insatiable thirst for glory, power, and untold riches, you will battle innumerable deadly creatures and uncover dark secrets as you pursue your damned ambitions.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/1136205c219da7b7816689ef26548c66.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party with up to four other friends, or, if you're brave enough, enter the darkness alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/70e744ea31e46cfebba20c101484d5ad.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble weapons from individual components: swords, maces, axes, polearms, spears, bows, or crossbows—the choice is yours. Customise all gear with materials, tints, and liveries to perfectly suit your playstyle and sense of fashion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/1b114a21c0de0ab6cd7385a8aaae368e.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means losing your character and everything they carry, permanently. If you want to return out alive with your hard-earned loot—be careful and deliberate. Anything stored in your base camp is safe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/63bf5dc5e47a633477d5594de1005dd3.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with resources from the depths to repair and upgrade your base of operations—exploit upgrades to assist with your next venture for more riches and antediluvian knowledge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/ce5dc924448216ec9a629aba62c74ff4.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmarish creatures, deadly traps, unstable structures, hidden drops, and toxic gasses—you have been warned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/4e5b46569a5c8b8f33deaf2c5d447801.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1131 height=131 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside piety and reach beyond the Empyrean to make deals with dark gods in exchange for forbidden power, but remember—everything comes at a price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.poster.avif?t=1792764392\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.webm?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/extras\/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.mp4?t=1792764392\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Brave forbidden dungeons in a quest for knowledge and treasure in this medieval PvE co-op extraction looter. Craft weapons, customise gear and join forces with up to four allies. Survive the ruins together—or lose everything you carry.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/6c1057f74c1c51a66ad161266524f0d772dddca7\/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1792764392","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/189fe22f13d84115951c0e2e35cc164d2275a1b4\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1792764392","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3126410\/189fe22f13d84115951c0e2e35cc164d2275a1b4\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1792764392","website":"https:\/\/expedition-the-game.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Radeon RX 580 Series or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Radeon RX 580 Series or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}